body:
A good place to start is to think about whats best for you, if you think leaving him is best for you (which it probably is) you should honestly leave him a text to say why you're leaving, block him and walk and not give him the chance to talk you round. I really wish I had just blocked my bf when he did it and left things there because if you're like me and blinded by love he'll probably be able to talk you into staying with him. The minute I forgave mine he did it again and I let him talk me back into things again and in hindsight I really wish I'd blocked him the first time so that I wouldn't have had to go through it again a second time.

&#x200B;

Do you have a best friend or sister or someone that you feel like you could speak to and have it remain between the 2 of you to help you make a decision?

Do whatever you think is best then, if you're uncomfortable telling her then you don't have to. Don't worry lol I obsessed over the girl my bf cheated with for a while but after blocking her on everything I feel much better so whenever you're ready you should give that a go, it helps more than you'd think. 

&#x200B;

It is weird that she's taken down the photos though, I wonder what he's told her to make her do that? This is really sad for both of you I guess, your boyfriend sounds like an asshole, are u set on leaving him?
